    cml:logicSummary "Definition of dishonesty" ;
    cml:premiseText "Dishonest means:  (a) dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people;  (b) known by the defendant to be dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people." ;
    cml:conclusionText "Dishonesty is defined as dishonest according to ordinary standards." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
