    cml:logicSummary "Communications are recurrent events." ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) a communication is in the course of telecommunications carriage; and  (b) the person causes the communication to be received by a person or carriage service other than the person or service to whom it is directed." ;
