concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(8) 6  Interference with facilities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474-6-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) For the purposes of this section, a facility is taken to be owned or operated by a nominated carrier if the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies, under section 81A of that Act, as if that facility were owned or operated by the nominated carrier." ;
    skos:definition "(8) For the purposes of this section, a facility is taken to be owned or operated by a nominated carrier if the Telecommunications Act 1997 applies, under section 81A of that Act, as if that facility were owned or operated by the nominated carrier."@en ;
