    values:originalText "(1) A person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the first person uses a carriage service to make to another person (the second person) a threat to kill the second person or a third person; and  (b) the first person intends the second person to fear that the threat will be carried out. Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years. Threat to cause serious harm" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-15-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(2) 15  Using a carriage service to make a threat"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474-15-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the first person uses a carriage service to make to another person (the second person) a threat to cause serious harm to the second person or a third person; and  (b) the first person intends the second person to fear that the threat will be carried out. Penalty: Imprisonment for 7 years.  Telecommunications offences  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004                    25 Actual fear not necessary" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person (the first person) is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the first person uses a carriage service to make to another person (the second person) a threat to cause serious harm to the second person or a third person; and  (b) the first person intends the second person to fear that the threat will be carried out. Penalty: Imprisonment for 7 years.  Telecommunications offences  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004                    25 Actual fear not necessary"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ae9a73bdbee7c14230370c84470468ae2a62436e55af826f2e89763f18726b48" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-15 ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Using a carriage service to make a threat is an offence." ;
