concept:act-sch-1-sec-474-15-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(4) 15  Using a carriage service to make a threat"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474-15-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In this section: fear includes apprehension. threat to cause serious harm to a person includes a threat to substantially contribute to serious harm to the person." ;
