doc:sch-1-sec-474-33-ss-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "474(9) 27(2)(c) or (3)(f) was represented to the sender as being:" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of sections 474.26 and 474.27, it does not matter that the recipient to whom the sender believes the sender is  Telecommunications offences  Schedule 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004                    37 transmitting the communication is a fictitious person represented to the sender as a real person. Attempt not offence" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

