    values:originalText "the time the communication was transmitted that the other person referred to in paragraph 474.26(2)(b) or (3)(e) or 474.27(2)(c) or (3)(f) was not at least 18 years of age.  Telecommunications offences  Schedule 1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-1-sec-38 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-38 ;
    values:originalText "Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004 Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section, see subsection 13.3(3).  (3) In determining whether the defendant had the belief referred to in subsection (1) or (2), the jury may take into account whether the alleged belief was reasonable in the circumstances." ;
    skos:definition "Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004 Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section, see subsection 13.3(3).  (3) In determining whether the defendant had the belief referred to in subsection (1) or (2), the jury may take into account whether the alleged belief was reasonable in the circumstances."@en ;
