concept:act-sch-1-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Telecommunications Offences and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004 Actual fear not necessary  (3) In a prosecution for an offence against this section, it is not necessary to prove that the person receiving the threat actually feared that the threat would be carried out. Definitions  (4) In this section: fear includes apprehension. threat to cause serious harm to a person includes a threat to substantially contribute to serious harm to the person." ;
    skos:definition "Other Measures) Act (No. 2) 2004 Actual fear not necessary  (3) In a prosecution for an offence against this section, it is not necessary to prove that the person receiving the threat actually feared that the threat would be carried out. Definitions  (4) In this section: fear includes apprehension. threat to cause serious harm to a person includes a threat to substantially contribute to serious harm to the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "33b421e7ab10951ffb5e869b0be3249d386dea500d9f5eba530a6a5b1a5835c2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
