    skos:prefLabel "21 Dictionary in the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: data held in a computer includes:  (a) data held in any removable data storage device for the time being held in a computer; or  (b) data held in a data storage device on a computer network of which the computer forms a part." ;
