onstitutional corporation that is a foreign corporation within the meaning of paragraph 51(xx) of the Constitution and the goods have been produced, manufactured, assembled or otherwise processed in Australia;  (vii) the loss takes the form of detriment to constitutional trade and commerce;  (viii) the goods are in the course of, or intended for, constitutional trade and commerce;  (ix) the contamination occurs outside Australia and the goods have been produced, manufactured, assembled or otherwise processed in Australia;  (x) the loss is a loss to the Commonwealth or a Commonwealth authority. Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years.  (3) Absolute liability applies to paragraph (2)(c)." ;
