concept:act-sch-2-sec-380-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "380 3  Threatening to contaminate goods"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-380-3 ;
    values:originalText "Offence based on implied nationhood power  (1) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person makes a threat that goods will be contaminated; and  (b) the person does so with intent:  (i) to cause public alarm or anxiety in Australia; or  (ii) to cause widespread, or nationally significant, economic loss in Australia through public awareness of the contamination, or possible contamination, of the goods; or  Contamination offence  Schedule 2" ;
    skos:definition "Offence based on implied nationhood power  (1) A person is guilty of an offence if:  (a) the person makes a threat that goods will be contaminated; and  (b) the person does so with intent:  (i) to cause public alarm or anxiety in Australia; or  (ii) to cause widespread, or nationally significant, economic loss in Australia through public awareness of the contamination, or possible contamination, of the goods; or  Contamination offence  Schedule 2"@en ;
