concept:act-sch-4-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Paragraph 135.2(1)(a) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) the person engages in conduct; and  (aa) as a result of that conduct, the person obtains a financial advantage for himself or herself from another person; and  (ab) the person knows or believes that he or she is not eligible to receive that financial advantage; and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) the person engages in conduct; and  (aa) as a result of that conduct, the person obtains a financial advantage for himself or herself from another person; and  (ab) the person knows or believes that he or she is not eligible to receive that financial advantage; and"@en ;
